  "content": "\"In a soft market, with cyber (re)insurers navigating a world of rising, increasingly complex threats, the underpenetration of the APAC market presents an opportunity. Growing competition has pushed cyber globally into its third consecutive year of rate reductions, as insurance supply continues to outpace demand,\" the report reads. \"This dynamic is offsetting recent exposure growth due to negative rate changes, and driving further concessions on premiums, coverage and security controls.\"",
